release) are frozen with PyInstaller and therefore redistribute the Python
interpreter and the libraries below. Installing from source with `pip` does
not redistribute anything -- pip fetches these from PyPI under their own
licenses -- so this section describes the release archives specifically.

To re-derive this list, inspect a built tree rather than the manifests:
`dist/deauth-correlator/_internal/`.

